  "worked_solution": "To integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \u27e8\\frac{1}{{t}^{2}},\\,-\\operatorname{cot}\u2061t\\operatorname{csc}\u2061t\u27e9\\text{d}t & =\u27e8\\int \\frac{1}{{t}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}t,\\,\\int -\\operatorname{cot}\u2061t\\operatorname{csc}\u2061t\\,\\text{d}t\u27e9 \\\\  & =\u27e8-\\frac{1}{t}+{c}_{1},\\,\\operatorname{csc}\u2061t+{c}_{2}\u27e9 \\\\  & =\u27e8-\\frac{1}{t},\\,\\operatorname{csc}\u2061t\u27e9+\u27e8{c}_{1},\\,{c}_{2}\u27e9 \\\\  & =\u27e8-\\frac{1}{t},\\,\\operatorname{csc}\u2061t\u27e9+C\\end{aligned}\n$$",
